<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48575" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tŏrōsus</span></b> , a, um,
			adj.
		torus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>full of muscle</i>, <i>muscular</i>, <i>brawny</i>, <i>fleshy</i>, <i>lusty.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">colla boum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					7, 429</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cervix boum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					6, 1, 3</span></i>
			; cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tauris torosior cervix,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 6,
					20</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">juventus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Pers.
					3, 86</span></i>
			. — </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">herba hirsutior torosiore caule,</span>”
				<i>more fleshy</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					21, 15, 53, § 90</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">19, 5, 29,
				§ 91</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">virgula,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Q. N. 1, 7, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">clava,</span>”
				<i>knotty</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Albin.
					2, 79</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
